WEBVTT

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:05.040
Okay, so here's a quick walkthrough of JobTally.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.961
First, you sign up with your email and password and put in a

00:00:07.961 --> 00:00:10.660
little information about your business.

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:14.557
Now, this is what your account could look like after about a

00:00:14.557 --> 00:00:16.400
month of using it.

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.560
Right at the top, you've got a time-off request.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:23.960
You see who it is, what day, and why.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:27.220
And you can approve it or deny it right there.

00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:29.630
Below that, you see who's on the clock,

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.520
what job they're at, and what time they got there.

00:00:34.420 --> 00:00:39.500
Then, what's owed to you and how many jobs you've got going.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.860
Here are your budget alerts.

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:44.368
Any time labor or material goes over,

00:00:44.368 --> 00:00:46.080
it shows up here.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:50.440
Then, this week, the plan for each job and what's getting done.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:53.470
Keep scrolling and this is where your insurance and

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:54.540
certifications go.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:58.660
Save them once and they'll be there whenever you need them.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:02.401
Now, the Jobs tab, create a job and see how many you have,

00:01:02.401 --> 00:01:05.100
what's started and what's done.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.360
Let's open one up.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:09.260
You see the materials and the labor.

00:01:09.260 --> 00:01:12.280
You can add receipts and see the old ones.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:15.300
Just snap a picture and fill in the information.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:19.640
You can add mileage too if you want to track your driving.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:23.620
Same thing if you've got a permit or any other documentation.

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:27.160
Now, the crew part.

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.980
A group chat with everybody on the job.

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:32.080
You can schedule your workers.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.980
There's a buy list so your workers know what to pick up

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:38.740
and the fix it list so they know what to do when they're on the job.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.380
Then, hours.

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:43.376
If you need to punch in someone's hours for them,

00:01:43.376 --> 00:01:45.260
you can do that here.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:49.180
Back on the job, you can add receipts and mileage.

00:01:49.180 --> 00:01:53.000
Then, you move it from not started to in progress to finished.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:56.700
That's pretty much everything inside a job.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:59.706
Back on the list, it warns you,

00:01:59.706 --> 00:02:01.980
this one's over budget.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:04.680
On labor, this one's almost there.

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:09.460
You can see your old jobs too and the receipts are still saved in there.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:12.085
Now, the Money tab, estimates, invoices,

00:02:12.085 --> 00:02:15.560
your clients and how the business is doing.

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:20.424
Reports and taxes, download the 2026 tax pack and you get

00:02:20.424 --> 00:02:22.600
everything in one.

00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:24.320
Next, the Crew tab.

00:02:24.320 --> 00:02:29.240
You can see who's on the clock right now and the whole week written out.

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:33.160
To add a worker, just put in their names and what you would pay them

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:36.080
and it would make an invite link.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:38.100
All you have to do is send them that invite link.

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:40.480
They don't even have to create an account or anything.

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:43.180
They can just start clocking in and out.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:47.000
I'll show you what that looks like from the worker's side in a second.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.600
Here's what you can see.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:54.200
You can see if they got paid or not and you can mark it as paid or not.

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.300
And last thing, the JobTally Assistant,

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:59.500
ask it what you need or tell it what you want to do.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.180
It'll get anything done for you.
